{"overview":"«مارتی مک‌فلای» 17 ساله است و با دانشمندی به نام «اِمت براون» آشنا می‌شود. این دانشمند در حال ساخت ماشین زمان است و قصد دارد آن را مورد آزمایش قرار دهد. این دو در لحظه‌ی امتحان ماشین زمان، مورد حمله‌ی یک گروه تروریستی قرار می‌گیرند و «مارتی» که سعی می‌کند از دست آنها فرار کند، به 30 سال قبل برمی‌گردد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Eighties teenager Marty McFly is accidentally sent back in time to 1955, inadvertently disrupting his parents' first meeting and attracting his mother's romantic interest. Marty must repair the damage to history by rekindling his parents' romance and - with the help of his eccentric inventor friend Doc Brown - return to 1985.","tagline_en":"He was never in time for his classes... He wasn't in time for his dinner... Then one day... he wasn't in his time at all.","runtime":116,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["رابرت زمکیس"],"crew_en":["Robert Zemeckis"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"مایکل جی. فاکس","role":"Marty McFly","photo":"/2JB4FMgQmnhbBlQ4SxWFN9EIVDi.jpg","en":"Michael J. Fox"},{"name":"کریستوفر لوید","role":"Emmett Brown","photo":"/nxVjpyb3UrfbPZnEyDNlQVlFAs5.jpg","en":"Christopher Lloyd"},{"name":"Crispin Glover","role":"George McFly","photo":"/imBnLpSXvg61qDDdEfvL6R4ITKt.jpg"},{"name":"Lea Thompson","role":"Lorraine Baines","photo":"/n7qTKpbAbr2P1RlcW1Lq1NhckQ2.jpg"},{"name":"Claudia Wells","role":"Jennifer Parker","photo":"/2VOsPvoV2vmEUd1O2KjW3kcN8JD.jpg"},{"name":"Thomas F. Wilson","role":"Biff Tannen","photo":"/mVhm65ZVBIRIptWGiMIvoUy0Khi.jpg"},{"name":"Marc McClure","role":"Dave McFly","photo":"/qOOd1C4rj8GbnXi8YKldwbHpa8z.jpg"},{"name":"Wendie Jo Sperber","role":"Linda McFly","photo":"/dufqiCvSBQUxuHmMXcH6U8fZG4k.jpg"},{"name":"George DiCenzo","role":"Sam Baines","photo":"/8L9fr5601BbUs3UzoCEELnxEKVm.jpg"},{"name":"Frances Lee McCain","role":"Stella Baines","photo":"/8KL73kRxsLDdrXPuMfiPET1EqH6.jpg"},{"name":"James Tolkan","role":"Mr. Strickland","photo":"/euEktcyVXm1pq5UBC16v3zuBq7J.j